---
import Layout from '../../Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Butterlu" description="Butterlu makes personalized picture frames for family milestones, made to order in two shapes and 44 backgrounds.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About Butterlu</h1>
    <p class="lede">Butterlu makes personalized picture frames for the moments families want to keep: a new grandbaby on the way, a godparent ask, a wedding thank-you, a pet who is missed.</p>
    <p>Every frame is made to order. Pick a shape and one of 44 backgrounds, keep our wording or write your own on any side, and we print it just as your preview shows.</p>
    <p>Thousands of shoppers found Butterlu on Etsy first. This shop is our own home for the same frames.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
